      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "VRCSDK 3.3.0 removes all features of control panel in PlayMode.\n\nI think all features except for \"Build\" or \"Build & Publish\" button should be available in Play Mode.\n\nEspecially, taking and uploading thumbnail is needed for non-destructive tools users.\n\nSo, I made the canny to request bring back taking thumbnail in play mode.\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/sdk-bug-reports/p/feedback-bring-back-ability-to-take-thumbnail-in-play-mode",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-08-29T15:34:58.102Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "We can click Build & Publish in PlayMode but it does do nothing.\n\nI think Build & Publish button should not be clickable in PlayMode.\n\nP.S. I think we should able to take thumbnail in PlayMode so I think Control Panel should be available even in PlayMode, only Build buttons should be disabled.",
